  "analysis": "ffmpeg silencedetect(-32dB,0.30s) fused with offline PocketSphinx word timestamps via difflib alignment to the canonical Day 2 script",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Yesterday, I found out that my world was going to restart in 100 days.",
      "start": 0.205,
      "end": 4.853
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Then some random stickman looked me dead in the eyes and told me I wasn't real.",
      "start": 4.873,
      "end": 10.004
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Naturally, I decided to find him.",
      "start": 10.371,
      "end": 12.388
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The problem? He had literally vanished into thin air.",
      "start": 12.817,
      "end": 15.976
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "I spent the next six hours searching the city, following strange glitches that appeared whenever I got close to something unusual.",
      "start": 16.36,
      "end": 23.795
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "A streetlight flickered whenever I walked underneath it.",
      "start": 24.181,
      "end": 26.52
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Every clock showed 11:11.",
      "start": 26.609,
      "end": 28.595
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "And one building had my apartment number on every single door.",
      "start": 29.09,
      "end": 32.824
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Then I found a message scratched into a wall.",
      "start": 34.007,
      "end": 36.577
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "STOP LOOKING FOR ME.",
      "start": 37.09,
      "end": 38.498
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Great. A mysterious warning from a guy who apparently doesn't believe in privacy.",
      "start": 38.97,
      "end": 43.316
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "I was about to leave when another message appeared beneath it.",
      "start": 43.763,
      "end": 46.5
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "LOOK UP.",
      "start": 46.913,
      "end": 47.733
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "So I did.",
      "start": 49.335,
      "end": 50.4
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "There he was, standing on top of a building that definitely hadn't existed five seconds earlier.",
      "start": 50.792,
      "end": 55.978
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "I ran upstairs, nearly fell through a staircase that kept changing direction, and finally reached the roof.",
      "start": 57.43,
      "end": 63.133
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "He was waiting for me.",
      "start": 63.502,
      "end": 64.446
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I asked him the obvious question.",
      "start": 64.837,
      "end": 66.409
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Who are you?",
      "start": 66.847,
      "end": 67.591
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "He looked at me and said, I'm the reason you're still alive.",
      "start": 68.062,
      "end": 71.683
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Before I could ask what that meant, he grabbed my arm and showed me something on his wrist.",
      "start": 72.114,
      "end": 76.276
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "A countdown.",
      "start": 76.296,
      "end": 76.776
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "The exact same countdown floating above my head.",
      "start": 76.796,
      "end": 80.311
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Except his didn't say 98 days.",
      "start": 80.648,
      "end": 82.833
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "It said zero.",
      "start": 82.853,
      "end": 84.85
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Then the sky started breaking apart.",
      "start": 85.79,
      "end": 87.978
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "He looked straight at me and whispered, when the timer reaches zero, the world doesn't restart.",
      "start": 87.998,
      "end": 93.185
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "He paused.",
      "start": 93.717,
      "end": 94.217
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "YOU do.",
      "start": 94.237,
      "end": 94.737
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "And then every person in the city turned their head toward us at the exact same time.",
      "start": 94.757,
      "end": 99.101
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "The mysterious stickman shoved a key into my hand.",
      "start": 99.414,
      "end": 101.899
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Find the room with no door, he said.",
      "start": 102.258,
      "end": 104.61
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "And whatever you do, don't trust the version of me you meet tomorrow.",
      "start": 104.63,
      "end": 108.116
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Then he disappeared.",
      "start": 108.545,
      "end": 109.8
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Now I've got a key that opens absolutely nothing, an entire city staring at me, and apparently another version of this guy coming tomorrow.",
      "start": 110.339,
      "end": 118.047
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "So what do I do?",
      "start": 118.349,
      "end": 119.875
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "A: Search for the room with no door.",
      "start": 119.895,
      "end": 122.032
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "B: Find out why everyone in the city is watching me.",
      "start": 122.052,
      "end": 125.565
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Because something tells me this world is hiding a lot more than a few glitches.",
      "start": 125.585,
      "end": 129.72
    }
  ],
